  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). No transitive pair.\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates ongoing rising or completed rise. ⟦{日|ひ}→日：02249_hi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{昇|のぼ}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'the sun has risen / is rising.'\n\nWRITING:\nThree kanji are used for のぼる, each with a different meaning:\n- {昇|のぼ}る: natural rising (sun, moon) — this entry\n- ⟦{登|のぼ}る→登る：00660_noboru⟧: climbing (mountains, stairs)\n- ⟦{上|のぼ}る→上る：21460_noboru⟧: going up (general upward movement)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{日|ひ}→日：02249_hi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{昇|のぼ}る: the sun rises\n- ⟦{太陽|たいよう}→太陽：03398_taiyou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{昇|のぼ}る: the sun rises\n- ⟦{月|つき}→月：02230_tsuki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{昇|のぼ}る: the moon rises\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{登|のぼ}る→登る：00660_noboru⟧: to climb (physical climbing)\n- ⟦{上|のぼ}る→上る：21460_noboru⟧: to go up (general)\n- ⟦{上|あ}がる→上がる：00615_agaru⟧: to rise, to go up",
